# Keep text files LF in the repository and in every checkout. Without this, a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true turns sources into CRLF, which breaks
# `pnpm format:check` (Prettier expects LF) and shell scripts, and makes byte-exact
# fixtures differ between platforms. Every tracked text file is already LF, so
# adding this rewrites nothing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalized, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mov binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.dill binary
